35
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>nani wo mitsumete iru darou</b></font></font></font></font>

36
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:58,380 --> 00:01:59,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

38
00:02:24,910 --> 00:02:25,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you?!</font>

39
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:45,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was you?
You killed him, didn't you?</font>

40
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:49,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... I don't know anything!</font>

41
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Cursed Warrior...?</font>

42
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:13,880
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">A White Cursed Samurai</font></font>

43
00:03:19,670 --> 00:03:23,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man's... snot!</font>

44
00:03:26,220 --> 00:03:30,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just can't get myself into training,
doing it alone...</font>

45
00:03:32,810 --> 00:03:36,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if we won't get a mission
connected to Sasuke or something.</font>

46
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:47,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of Birds?
From such a remote land...</font>

47
00:03:48,330 --> 00:03:50,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what's troubling us.</font>

48
00:03:51,290 --> 00:03:55,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The "Cursed Warrior" apparition has been
disturbing the castle town</font>

49
00:03:55,500 --> 00:03:57,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and misleading the public, huh?</font>

50
00:03:58,550 --> 00:04:00,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, they want us to exterminate a ghost?</font>

51
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:04,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I declined once saying
we can't go so far</font>

52
00:04:04,430 --> 00:04:07,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as to accept the extermination
of a ghost, but...</font>

53
00:04:15,230 --> 00:04:20,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must have you accept this at any cost.
Please accept!</font>

54
00:04:26,490 --> 00:04:28,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it because the money isn't enough?</font>

55
00:04:29,290 --> 00:04:32,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We in the Land of Birds are
experiencing financial difficulties.</font>

56
00:04:32,330 --> 00:04:34,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even this is the very limit
the budget will allow...</font>

57
00:04:34,830 --> 00:04:36,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not an issue of money.</font>

58
00:04:37,290 --> 00:04:39,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,
it's the mission details.</font>

59
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be that as it may,</font>

60
00:04:42,090 --> 00:04:45,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">indeed there isn't even enough to
cover travel expenses with this amount.</font>

61
00:04:45,510 --> 00:04:47,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that things have come
to this pass...</font>

62
00:04:47,430 --> 00:04:49,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I shall commit harakiri.</font>

63
00:04:51,220 --> 00:04:52,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be hasty!</font>

64
00:04:52,390 --> 00:04:53,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes!</font>

65
00:05:03,690 --> 00:05:06,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the little bit of pocket money
I have saved up.</font>

66
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:09,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll pay out of my own pocket.
So, with this, please!</font>

67
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that's why you accepted it?</font>

68
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:23,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's indulgent even for me.</font>

69
00:05:23,590 --> 00:05:28,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nonetheless, most of the
Jonin and Chunin are out on missions.</font>

70
00:05:28,180 --> 00:05:30,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was thinking of how to handle this...</font>

71
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:36,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess someone's talking about you.</font>

72
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:40,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone's busy with missions,
so, they don't have time for such things.</font>

73
00:05:52,660 --> 00:05:54,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's that guy?</font>

74
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:56,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's been like that since earlier.</font>

75
00:06:05,460 --> 00:06:09,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even tasty ramen won't go down the throat
right being watched like that!</font>

76
00:06:09,590 --> 00:06:11,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come inside and eat if you're hungry!</font>

77
00:06:11,430 --> 00:06:13,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I'm not hungry.</font>

78
00:06:28,740 --> 00:06:31,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So? Tasty, huh?</font>

79
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

80
00:06:34,330 --> 00:06:35,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for your business.</font>

81
00:06:35,540 --> 00:06:37,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come back and have Naruto
treat you again.</font>

82
00:06:38,710 --> 00:06:41,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Again and again like that?
Give me a break.</font>

83
00:06:41,710 --> 00:06:45,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you for treating me.
In appreciation...</font>

84
00:06:45,340 --> 00:06:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, you don't need to worry about it.</font>

85
00:06:48,670 --> 00:06:50,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But hey, what's your name?</font>

86
00:06:51,260 --> 00:06:53,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not a familiar face
from this village.</font>

87
00:06:53,970 --> 00:06:57,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, my name is Chishima and
I have come from the Land of Birds.</font>

88
00:06:57,810 --> 00:07:00,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I came to the Village Hidden in the Leaves
to commission a mission.</font>

89
00:07:00,940 --> 00:07:04,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're flat broke even though
you came as a messenger of your land?</font>

90
00:07:05,020 --> 00:07:07,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There wasn't enough money
for the commission,</font>

91
00:07:07,150 --> 00:07:08,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so, I even used up
my own pocket money.</font>

92
00:07:08,990 --> 00:07:12,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then it must be
a very important mission, huh?</font>

93
00:07:13,700 --> 00:07:17,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It might even cost an important friend
of mine's very life.</font>

94
00:07:17,330 --> 00:07:21,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your friend...?
What the heck do you mean?</font>

95
00:07:23,750 --> 00:07:25,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ever since I was little,</font>

96
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:29,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was raised as a brother with Lord Sagi,
the feudal lord of the Land of Birds.</font>

97
00:07:29,470 --> 00:07:32,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're friends with a feudal lord?!</font>

98
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:33,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said feudal lord,</font>

99
00:07:34,010 --> 00:07:39,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but he was only just appointed last year
and actually he's the same age as me.</font>

100
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:43,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No kidding?
Then he's a totally young feudal lord.</font>

101
00:07:43,310 --> 00:07:49,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. The previous feudal lord,
his father, Lord Owashi, died from illness</font>

102
00:07:49,820 --> 00:07:53,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and after that he even lost
his twin sister.</font>

103
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:55,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ever since then,</font>

104
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:59,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Sagi, who was so cheerful,
has become a totally different person.</font>

105
00:07:59,830 --> 00:08:03,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He wouldn't show his face
even if I visited.</font>

106
00:08:06,790 --> 00:08:10,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm worried about him as
a friend rather than a feudal lord.</font>

107
00:08:11,090 --> 00:08:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was thinking something might
have happened to him.</font>

108
00:08:15,430 --> 00:08:17,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, if there is something
I can do,</font>

109
00:08:17,470 --> 00:08:20,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to do whatever I can,
as a friend.</font>

110
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:27,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't... save Sasuke.
But this guy's still...</font>

111
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:30,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me.</font>

112
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:31,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

113
00:08:31,860 --> 00:08:34,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's save your friend!</font>

114
00:08:35,530 --> 00:08:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

115
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:44,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade! You're mean!</font>

116
00:08:46,290 --> 00:08:50,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, you could at least knock
when entering my office.</font>

117
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly, what do you mean
by fleecing bro of his pocket money</font>

118
00:08:55,340 --> 00:08:57,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and then not accepting the mission?!</font>

119
00:08:59,100 --> 00:09:03,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People call stuff like that devilish!
You old lady devil!</font>

120
00:09:05,730 --> 00:09:07,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Try saying that again!</font>

121
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry!</font>

122
00:09:13,740 --> 00:09:17,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if Naruto... is okay.</font>

123
00:09:17,780 --> 00:09:19,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll be fine.</font>

124
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:21,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've gotten to know a good guy.</font>

125
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He may not look it,
but he's quite dependable.</font>

126
00:09:25,790 --> 00:09:26,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

127
00:09:28,210 --> 00:09:29,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

128
00:09:30,710 --> 00:09:33,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who said I wouldn't accept the mission?</font>

129
00:09:33,260 --> 00:09:37,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I see. So, you were waiting for Neji
to finish his mission and come back.</font>

130
00:09:38,010 --> 00:09:39,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Half-cocked jerk.</font>

131
00:09:42,430 --> 00:09:45,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee is on a mission with Guy.</font>

132
00:09:45,140 --> 00:09:50,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You and Tenten will form a three-man team
with Neji as the leader, got it?</font>

133
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:55,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then did you hear from that kid
about the mission details?</font>

134
00:09:55,820 --> 00:09:58,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well actually, not yet.</font>

135
00:10:00,950 --> 00:10:02,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the extermination of a ghost.</font>

136
00:10:04,330 --> 00:10:06,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A ghost?</font>

137
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:09,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that it appears when
you're walking through town at night.</font>

138
00:10:09,330 --> 00:10:12,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A ghost clad in white armor.</font>

139
00:10:14,420 --> 00:10:16,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what you'll...</font>

140
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:23,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't hear anything about a ghost.</font>

141
00:10:23,390 --> 00:10:25,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you scared of it?</font>

142
00:10:25,430 --> 00:10:30,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not scared. I couldn't be a ninja
if I got scared at stuff like that!</font>

143
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:36,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But does Ninjutsu work on ghosts?</font>

144
00:10:36,900 --> 00:10:38,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows?</font>

145
00:10:39,530 --> 00:10:41,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Try testing it out yourself.</font>

146
00:10:55,170 --> 00:10:57,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, why didn't you say at the start</font>

147
00:10:57,460 --> 00:11:00,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that it was a commission
to exterminate a ghost?!</font>

148
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:02,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't tell you?</font>

149
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:08,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not even a word.
But that's just a rumor anyway, right?</font>

150
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:10,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I haven't seen it, but...</font>

151
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:12,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See?</font>

152
00:11:12,520 --> 00:11:16,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it seems my master,
Lord Moso, saw it close up.</font>

153
00:11:17,820 --> 00:11:19,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For real?!</font>

154
00:11:19,950 --> 00:11:23,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of Birds, huh?
That's sure far.</font>

155
00:11:28,250 --> 00:11:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}{"Village Hidden in the Leaves"</b></font>

156
00:12:20,050 --> 00:12:22,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there more?</font>

157
00:12:22,630 --> 00:12:25,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You sure eat a lot considering
you're thin.</font>

158
00:12:26,010 --> 00:12:29,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry. I'm often called
a skinny voracious eater.</font>

159
00:12:31,020 --> 00:12:35,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, by the way, is there really such
a thing as the Cursed Warrior?</font>

160
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are people who say</font>

161
00:12:37,650 --> 00:12:40,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's the disembodied spirit of
the previous feudal lord, Lord Owashi.</font>

162
00:12:40,940 --> 00:12:43,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The disembodied spirit of
a dead feudal lord...</font>

163
00:12:45,780 --> 00:12:47,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rather than ghosts,</font>

164
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:50,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">tell us a little more about
the Land of Birds.</font>

165
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:51,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure.</font>

166
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:55,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The capital of the Land of Birds
stretches across the banks of the lake</font>

167
00:12:55,790 --> 00:12:57,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where migratory birds rest...</font>

168
00:12:58,540 --> 00:13:01,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a peaceful town
with lots of green</font>

169
00:13:01,050 --> 00:13:04,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and where water from the lake would
be drawn into the canals.</font>

170
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:08,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, after the sudden death of
the previous feudal lord,</font>

171
00:13:09,010 --> 00:13:10,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there was much uproar.</font>

172
00:13:11,060 --> 00:13:15,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His son, Lord Sagi, and Lord Komei,
the previous tactician,</font>

173
00:13:15,230 --> 00:13:17,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">were nominated to be
the next feudal lords.</font>

174
00:13:18,690 --> 00:13:21,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Lord Komei thought Lord Sagi
was still too young</font>

175
00:13:21,690 --> 00:13:24,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and was vehemently opposed
to him assuming the feudal lordship.</font>

176
00:13:25,570 --> 00:13:28,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But in the end, Lord Sagi
took the seat of feudal lord</font>

177
00:13:28,700 --> 00:13:31,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the matter was closed
with Moso the high priest</font>

178
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:34,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">providing tutelage as
a superintendent official.</font>

179
00:13:38,750 --> 00:13:41,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, before even half
a year passed,</font>

180
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:44,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Toki, his twin sister,
died suddenly.</font>

181
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:56,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After that, Lord Sagi
who was so cheerful</font>

182
00:13:56,350 --> 00:13:59,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">turned into a totally different person,
became coldhearted</font>

183
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and he now conducts governmental
matters confined in his mansion.</font>

184
00:14:04,820 --> 00:14:05,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From about that time,</font>

185
00:14:05,940 --> 00:14:09,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the "Cursed Warrior" began appearing
in the castle town.</font>

186
00:14:10,570 --> 00:14:15,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those in the castle town say
that Lord Owashi was killed by someone.</font>

187
00:14:16,460 --> 00:14:18,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are even those who say
that the Cursed Warrior</font>

188
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:21,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is the ghost of Lord Owashi
searching for the person</font>

189
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:24,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who drove him to death and is attempting
to have his revenge.</font>

190
00:14:25,760 --> 00:14:27,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's scary.</font>

191
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:31,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no such thing as ghosts.</font>

192
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:32,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

193
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:35,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That priest Moso is the one</font>

194
00:14:35,270 --> 00:14:37,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who gained the most
from Owashi's death, huh?</font>

195
00:14:37,390 --> 00:14:41,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Moso is a magnificent person
of virtue with no self-interest!</font>

196
00:14:41,150 --> 00:14:43,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then the suspicious one is...</font>

197
00:14:43,480 --> 00:14:46,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only one left is Komei the tactician.</font>

198
00:14:46,780 --> 00:14:48,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I bet he assassinated Owashi</font>

199
00:14:48,900 --> 00:14:51,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in an attempt to become
the feudal lord, but failed.</font>

200
00:14:52,620 --> 00:14:55,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has complained whenever
opportunity offered itself,</font>

201
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:57,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after Lord Sagi became
the feudal lord as well.</font>

202
00:14:57,540 --> 00:15:00,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A tactic like tormenting Lord Sagi
by starting the rumor</font>

203
00:15:00,210 --> 00:15:03,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">about the Cursed Warrior might be
a piece of cake for Lord Komei.</font>

204
00:15:04,250 --> 00:15:06,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! There's no doubt.</font>

205
00:15:06,800 --> 00:15:10,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's settled. The true identity of
the Cursed Warrior is Komei!</font>

206
00:15:11,470 --> 00:15:13,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The true identity of the ghost
is revealed, huh?</font>

207
00:15:33,450 --> 00:15:37,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Komei, there was nothing unusual
on the scheduled patrol.</font>

208
00:15:42,580 --> 00:15:44,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You may step down.</font>

209
00:15:44,080 --> 00:15:45,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir.</font>

210
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:44,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aren't we at our destination yet?!</font>

211
00:16:44,350 --> 00:16:46,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a little further until
Lord Moso's residence.</font>

212
00:16:53,570 --> 00:16:54,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is he?! This way?</font>

213
00:16:55,950 --> 00:16:57,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did he go?!</font>

214
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:59,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There he is!</font>

215
00:17:00,490 --> 00:17:03,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get him! Drag him down!</font>

216
00:17:08,590 --> 00:17:10,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cursed Warrior!</font>

217
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:14,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He vanished.</font>

218
00:17:16,180 --> 00:17:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Komei! Are you all right?!</font>

219
00:17:20,470 --> 00:17:23,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm fine. Don't panic!</font>

220
00:17:28,020 --> 00:17:28,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?!</font>

221
00:17:37,490 --> 00:17:38,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's flying?!</font>

222
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:45,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clad in white armor,
possesses a halberd,</font>

223
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:49,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and wears a mask with
a frightening look...</font>

224
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:52,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no doubt.
It's the Cursed Warrior!</font>

225
00:17:52,250 --> 00:17:53,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After him!</font>

226
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:57,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you going to ride on
my shoulders forever?</font>

227
00:17:57,800 --> 00:18:01,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait here! I'll pin down
the true identity of the ghost!</font>

228
00:18:02,010 --> 00:18:03,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

229
00:18:19,530 --> 00:18:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where'd he go?!</font>

230
00:18:20,990 --> 00:18:21,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over there!</font>

231
00:18:39,840 --> 00:18:40,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

232
00:18:50,600 --> 00:18:51,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't see him...</font>

233
00:18:52,810 --> 00:18:54,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does that mean?!</font>

234
00:18:54,690 --> 00:18:57,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no human presence in here.</font>

235
00:18:58,820 --> 00:19:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At least, a living presence...</font>

236
00:19:01,660 --> 00:19:05,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you put it that way?</font>

237
00:19:05,950 --> 00:19:08,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't you hear
something just now?</font>

238
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:20,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought you didn't feel
a human presence!</font>

239
00:19:21,760 --> 00:19:24,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you... living presence.</font>

240
00:19:31,020 --> 00:19:33,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you want?!</font>

241
00:19:33,860 --> 00:19:35,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it, damn it.</font>

242
00:19:36,820 --> 00:19:38,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little...</font>

243
00:19:41,320 --> 00:19:42,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chain Weight!</font>

244
00:19:57,250 --> 00:20:01,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There can't be something like ghosts.
No such things as ghosts!</font>

245
00:20:01,170 --> 00:20:03,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop, Naruto! He's...</font>

246
00:20:04,180 --> 00:20:06,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

247
00:20:12,360 --> 00:20:14,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">U-Zu-Ma-Ki!</font>

248
00:20:18,690 --> 00:20:20,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto Barrage!</font>

249
00:20:35,460 --> 00:20:39,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! Now I'll verify the true identity!</font>

250
00:20:43,340 --> 00:20:44,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

251
00:20:48,220 --> 00:20:51,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The insides are empty.</font>

252
00:20:53,060 --> 00:20:54,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means...</font>

253
00:20:57,730 --> 00:21:01,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a real ghost!</font>

254
00:21:18,050 --> 00:21:29,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>dokomademo tsudzuku michi ni wa ironna koto arunda ne</b></font></font></font></font>

255
00:21:18,050 --> 00:21:29,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>so many things happen on this endless road, right?</b></font></font></font></font>

256
00:21:29,700 --> 00:21:41,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>tsuyogari na kimi ga kyou wa juwaki koshi ni namida koe</b></font></font></font></font>

257
00:21:29,700 --> 00:21:41,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>although you're strong-willed your voice wavered on the phone today</b></font></font></font></font>

258
00:21:41,300 --> 00:21:52,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>donna yume oikakete kokomade kitan darou</b></font></font></font></font>

259
00:21:41,300 --> 00:21:52,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>what dreams did you chase to get here?</b></font></font></font></font>

260
00:21:52,090 --> 00:22:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>wakara na kunattari suru koto wa boku ni datte aru kara nee BABY</b></font></font></font></font>

261
00:21:52,090 --> 00:22:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even I have times when I just don't understand baby</b></font></font></font></font>

262
00:22:04,430 --> 00:22:15,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>kimi ga namida no toki ni wa boku ga soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

263
00:22:04,430 --> 00:22:15,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>when you're sad I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

264
00:22:15,950 --> 00:22:27,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>hanareba nare no yoru datte boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

265
00:22:15,950 --> 00:22:27,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even on nights when we're apart I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

266
00:22:27,550 --> 00:22:33,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

267
00:22:27,550 --> 00:22:33,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

268
00:22:38,420 --> 00:22:41,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">So that's Sagi,
the feudal lord of this land, huh?</font>

269
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:44,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">He's far away,
but he might be quite cool.</font>

270
00:22:44,500 --> 00:22:45,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Shh, be quiet!</font>

271
00:22:45,800 --> 00:22:47,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What is it, Neji?</font>

272
00:22:47,380 --> 00:22:50,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Something's strange.
What's with this blood thirst?</font>

273
00:22:50,300 --> 00:22:53,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What? Bloodthirsty?
Could it be assassins?</font>

274
00:22:53,390 --> 00:22:57,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">They might be Shinobi.
Is everyone ready?!</font>

275
00:22:57,480 --> 00:22:58,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— Yeah.
— Yeah.</font>

276
00:22:58,440 --> 00:23:00,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'll protect the feudal lord!</font>

277
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:03,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Tactician Komei's Speculation."</font>

